 and document-model ports consuming accepted XML2 and taskqueue contracts. Two std-only shells; no implementation acceptance.\n\n# Files allowed to touch\n- `work/WO-RUST-WAVE5-SETUP-01.md`\n- `work/WO-RUST-SVG-INDEX-01.md`\n- `work/WO-RUST-DOCUMENT-MODEL-01.md`\n- `Cargo.toml`\n- `Cargo.lock`\n- `rust/crates/vexel-svg-index/Cargo.toml`\n- `rust/crates/vexel-svg-index/src/lib.rs`\n- `rust/crates/vexel-document/Cargo.toml`\n- `rust/crates/vexel-document/src/lib.rs`\n- `artifacts/WO-RUST-WAVE5-SETUP-01/**`\n- `artifacts/WO-RUST-WAVE4-SETUP-01/integrate_candidate.py`\n- `docs/product/rust-port-goal-and-plan.md`\n- `STATE.md`\n- `LEDGER.md`\n- `ledger.jsonl`\n\n# Protected paths and contracts\nAll accepted Rust source/existing manifests, original603legacy files/oracles/assertions, prior frozen orders and evidence, active wave4 worker trees. No deps/download/install/network/unsafe/C shim/unsupported OS/stage/commit/delete/reset. One writer per distinct newcrate; mac13+ only. Index safe caller-borrowed Arc<Vec> plus cloned worker owner avoids self-reference; actual background bounded validation required. Model borrows source and owns bounded tables/handles. Root alone shared interfaces/integration; update older wave4 helper only to accept exact new registration hashes after this setup accepted. Standard subscription LunaHigh, no APIbilling/extra credits/recursive agents. Independent setup review before launch.\n\n# Verification\ncargo +stable generate-lockfile --offline\ncargo +stable check --workspace --locked --offline\npython3 scripts/wo_validate.py WO-RUST-WAVE5-SETUP-01 --ready\npython3 scripts/ledger.py validate ledger.jsonl\ngit diff --check\nValidate both new frozen orders and original603/index/acceptedRust source hashes. Existing1.99/localcaches/mac13. No application/UI tests for setup.\n\n# Output\nAccepted registrations only, ready scopes, current-source isolated overlays/process registry and complete product goal retained.\n---\nid: WO-RUST-SVG-INDEX-01\nrevision: 1\nstatus: READY\nmilestone: RUST-MIGRATION\nowner: project-owner\nexecutor: codex-gpt-6-luna\nbase_sha: 19234a036ed6a8d40c2ccdaec9b8186806d70eca\nspec_sha256: 710311f2f5d816abc33894a96fcd53951bc6506ed89c0be1ff9ba007341cac39\nparallel_safe: true\nnetwork: false\n---\n# Goal and frozen scope\nPort EVERY function/helper in src/svg/index/index.c/h against accepted XmlReader, XmlTokenStream and TaskQueue. Safe IndexSession borrows immutable caller Arc<Vec<u8>> for lifetime: reader borrows caller bytes while validation worker clones Arc, avoiding self-referential struct, unsafe borrowed thread pointers or unconditional entire-source copy. Source bytes unchanged; no smaller source cap. Full owner lexical scan plus actual independent background bounded validation, start/step/progress/generation/preview/currentness/cancel/elements/tokens/synthetic preview/drop. Preserve1GiBsource/64KiBmaxstep/1Melements/1Mattributes/256depth/256MiBstorage with128MiBcomponent budgets; charge actual reserved metadata/token storage. Preserve original support subset/root/attribute gate, first completed supported rect/path preview and validation frontier gate, exact diagnostics/error precedence, no tokens until full validation, generation invalidation and owned <=16MiB synthetic preview bytes. Shutdown cancels/joins worker before shared buffers release; successfulworker result ownership/atomic visibility correct and error storage not partially exposed. Accepted taskqueue callbacks always run after Running even canceled: validator polls token and cannot publish canceled/stale results. No placeholder synchronous validation/thread-blocking join per step or scan-then-whole-parse substitute. Port meaningful original index cases: incremental budget/progress, previews versus malformed prefix/tail, unsupported root/attrs, generation, cancellation, full token source spans, nested parent/source spans, resource bounds and teardown. Deterministic bounded worker wait seams allowed, no timing-only flaky 